{"id":71,"date":"2020-09-19T17:07:57","date_gmt":"2020-09-19T17:07:57","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/?page_id=71"},"modified":"2025-03-20T13:45:21","modified_gmt":"2025-03-20T13:45:21","slug":"our-story","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/our-story\/","title":{"rendered":"About AIMS Ghana"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover is-light has-custom-content-position is-position-bottom-left pad-5\" style=\"min-height:600px\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-30 has-background-dim\" style=\"background-color:#161228\"><\/span><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-3374\" alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/IMG_9877-scaled.jpg\" style=\"object-position:28% 31%\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" data-object-position=\"28% 31%\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/IMG_9877-scaled.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/IMG_9877-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/IMG_9877-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/IMG_9877-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/IMG_9877-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/IMG_9877-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/IMG_9877-16x12.jpg 16w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\">\n<h1 class=\"has-white-color has-text-color\">About AIMS Ghana<\/h1>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-group pad-5\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\">\n<h2>Overview<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Established in 2012 with the support of the Government of Ghana, AIMS Ghana is the third Centre of Excellence to be created under the AIMS Global Network (AIMS Next Einstein Initiative). AIMS Ghana offers:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>A Master\u2019s in Mathematical Sciences through a Structured 10-month research-oriented program<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>African Masters in Machine Intelligence (AMMI)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>A Masters in Mathematical Sciences for Teachers (MMST)<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-vivid-red-color has-text-color\"><strong><a href=\"https:\/\/unescoghana.gov.gh\/about-us\/institutes-centres\/\">&#8220;AIMS Ghana is a UNESCO Category II Centre of Excellence&#8221;<\/a><\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Additionally, AIMS Ghana Master&#8217;s programs are accredited by the National Accreditation Board (Ghana). Since its inception, AIMS Ghana has graduated over 500 students, 33% of them being women.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>AIMS has been providing outstanding education to Africa\u2019s top talents since 2003, with graduates developing the skills, knowledge, networks and inspiration to take up careers in teaching, industry, business and governance. Its unique training program teaches analytical thinking and problem-solving skills, and exposes students to many applied fields which are of relevance to Africa\u2019s development, such as finance, health, food production, climate change, natural resource management, technology and others.<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-advgb-columns advgb-columns-wrapper\" id=\"advgb-cols-ade49356-e8a5-41df-9fe6-4df6b8cb2765\"><div class=\"advgb-columns-container\"><div class=\"advgb-columns advgb-columns-row advgb-is-mobile columns-valign-middle advgb-columns-2 layout-12-12 mbl-layout-stacked vgutter-10\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-advgb-column advgb-column advgb-is-half-tablet advgb-is-full-mobile\" id=\"advgb-col-882756fe-de92-451e-95a2-ba727facbda2\" style=\"flex:none\"><div class=\"advgb-column-inner\" style=\"border-style:none;border-width:1px\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover aligncenter is-light\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-0 has-background-dim\"><\/span><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-2953\" alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/Call-to-action-scaled.jpg\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/Call-to-action-scaled.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/Call-to-action-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/Call-to-action-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/Call-to-action-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/Call-to-action-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/Call-to-action-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/Call-to-action-16x12.jpg 16w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\">\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-large-font-size\"><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-advgb-column advgb-column advgb-is-half-tablet advgb-is-full-mobile\" id=\"advgb-col-1d678a07-4a88-470b-8169-2ba798fc5ee1\"><div class=\"advgb-column-inner\" style=\"border-style:none;border-width:1px\">\n<h2>AIMS is a call to Action to:<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Invest in STEM education for the advancement of development in Africa;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Increase collaboration between the public and private sector to prioritize STEM education in Africa;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Encourage policymakers to push the Agenda of STEM education in Africa for the transformation of and sustainable growth of the continent, especially as pertains to increasing the number of women in the STEM fields;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Get Africa\u2019s most talented students to pursue an education in mathematical sciences to innovate and further propel Africa\u2019s future;<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Increase partnership with industry to fill the gap in STEM, increase productivity and provide critical skills that are indispensable as Africa embarks on its industrial revolution.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-group pad-5 bg-alt has-white-color has-text-color\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\">\n<h2><strong>About AIMS<\/strong><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The African Institute for Mathematical Sciences (AIMS) is a pan-African network of Centres of Excellence for postgraduate training in mathematical sciences, research, and public engagement in Science, Technology, Engineering, and Mathematics. Founded in 2003 in South Africa by acclaimed physicist Prof Neil Turok and later replicated in Senegal, Ghana, Cameroon and Rwanda, AIMS is leading Africa\u2019s socio-economic transformation through:<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>\u2022 Innovative scientific training (the development of human capital);<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>\u2022 Technological advances and cutting-edge scientific discoveries; and<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>\u2022 Public engagement for the continent\u2019s scientific emergence.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Africa\u2019s youth are at the heart of the AIMS innovation and transformation ecosystem which consists of a set of academic and non-academic programs expertly tailored to provide AIMS learners with a unique postgraduate training experience on the continent.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>AIMS offers a Master\u2019s in mathematical sciences, including a co-operative option with a direct link to industry, the African Master\u2019s in Machine Intelligence (AMMI), as well as research programs, with over 100 researchers conducting studies across the network. In addition to the AIMS Industry Initiative and a gender-responsive Teacher Training Program currently implemented in Cameroon and Rwanda, AIMS equally created two critical initiatives: Quantum Leap Africa, a think tank looking into the coming quantum revolution and the Next Einstein Forum to propel Africa on to the global scientific stage.&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-advgb-columns advgb-columns-wrapper\" id=\"advgb-cols-3b896de5-89ca-4c95-8d8a-763f1f2522c1\"><div class=\"advgb-columns-container\"><div class=\"advgb-columns advgb-columns-row advgb-is-mobile advgb-columns-2 layout-12-12 mbl-layout-stacked vgutter-10\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-advgb-column advgb-column advgb-is-half-tablet advgb-is-full-mobile pad-5\" id=\"advgb-col-c71df459-9949-4912-bca3-08b96905a149\"><div class=\"advgb-column-inner\" style=\"border-style:none;border-width:1px\">\n<h2>Our Values<\/h2>\n\n\n \n\n\n<div class=\"icon-title\" > \n\n<div class=\"icon-title-img\"> <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2020\/09\/icon-excellence.png\"> <\/div>\n<div class=\"icon-title-text bg-alt\"> <h3 class=\"sans-serif-bold white-text\"> EXCELLENCE <\/h3> <\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n \n\n\n<div class=\"icon-title\" > \n\n<div class=\"icon-title-img\"> <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2023\/01\/use-removebg-preview.png\"> <\/div>\n<div class=\"icon-title-text bg-primary\"> <h3 class=\"sans-serif-bold white-text\"> EQUITY AND INCLUSION <\/h3> <\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n \n\n\n<div class=\"icon-title\" > \n\n<div class=\"icon-title-img\"> <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2020\/09\/icon-panafricanism.png\"> <\/div>\n<div class=\"icon-title-text bg-alt\"> <h3 class=\"sans-serif-bold white-text\"> PAN-AFRICANISM <\/h3> <\/div>\n\n<\/div>\n\n \n\n\n<div class=\"icon-title\" > \n\n<div class=\"icon-title-img\"> <img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2020\/09\/icon-integrity.png\"> <\/div>\n<div class=\"icon-title-text bg-primary\"> <h3 class=\"sans-serif-bold white-text\"> INTEGRITY <\/h3> <\/div>\n\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-advgb-column advgb-column advgb-is-half-tablet advgb-is-full-mobile stretch-content-height\" id=\"advgb-col-8035b563-a7c5-4a8a-978d-4151d90d55ea\"><div class=\"advgb-column-inner\" style=\"border-style:none;border-width:1px\">\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-group pad-5 has-white-color has-text-color has-background\" style=\"background-color:#161228\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\">\n<h2 class=\"has-text-align-right\">Vision<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right has-red-color has-text-color\">Our vision is to see a&nbsp;prosperous Africa, propelled by innovative education and mathematical science.&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-group pad-5 bg-alt has-white-color has-text-color\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\">\n<h2 class=\"has-text-align-right\">Mission<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-text-align-right has-red-color has-text-color\">Our mission is to empower talented young Africans to be creative leaders in science and technology.&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-advgb-columns advgb-columns-wrapper\" id=\"advgb-cols-2a810eb4-c421-4cb3-be9d-92fcbf58fff5\"><div class=\"advgb-columns-container\"><div class=\"advgb-columns advgb-columns-row advgb-is-mobile advgb-columns-2 layout-12-12 mbl-layout-stacked vgutter-10\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-advgb-column advgb-column advgb-is-half-tablet advgb-is-full-mobile\" id=\"advgb-col-e4d9a87b-eafb-4c4a-a13b-c1408e52cd14\"><div class=\"advgb-column-inner\" style=\"border-style:none;border-width:1px\">\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-group pad-5-10\"><div class=\"wp-block-group__inner-container\">\n<h2>The AIMS Model<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The AIMS model is unique in its pan-African character, broad curriculum, focus on independent critical thinking, inclusion of modern computational techniques and research components. AIMS identifies top African graduates and provides them with a world-class education in mathematical sciences, enabling them to pursue careers in research, industry and civil society. Students benefit from full or partial scholarships, continuous access to computing, internet and electricity, close interaction with full-time tutors and visiting professors, as well as exposure to English and French. Endorsed by <a href=\"https:\/\/nepad.org\/programme-details\/999#:~:text=AIMS%20was%20designated%20as%20a,Education%2C%20and%20Science%20and%20Technology.\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">NEPAD<\/a>, the African Union and TED as an idea big enough to change the world, this model has been refined and proven at five AIMS Centres of Excellence in South Africa, Senegal, Ghana, Cameroon, and Rwanda, with over 2200 graduates transitioning into careers all over the globe in data science, education, entrepreneurship, ICT, and research, among other domains.&nbsp;<\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-advgb-column advgb-column advgb-is-half-tablet advgb-is-full-mobile\" id=\"advgb-col-c0551a84-07c6-4c99-9624-56e73fe549dd\"><div class=\"advgb-column-inner\" style=\"border-style:none;border-width:1px\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"859\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/apply-for-AIMS-tutoring-fellowship-background-nn-1024x859.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-2420\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/apply-for-AIMS-tutoring-fellowship-background-nn-1024x859.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/apply-for-AIMS-tutoring-fellowship-background-nn-300x252.jpg 300w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/apply-for-AIMS-tutoring-fellowship-background-nn-768x644.jpg 768w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/apply-for-AIMS-tutoring-fellowship-background-nn-1536x1288.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/apply-for-AIMS-tutoring-fellowship-background-nn-2048x1718.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/03\/apply-for-AIMS-tutoring-fellowship-background-nn-14x12.jpg 14w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover is-light\" style=\"min-height:426px\"><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim\"><\/span><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"2560\" height=\"1707\" class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-1385\" alt=\"\" src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/02\/IMG_1291-min-scaled.jpg\" data-object-fit=\"cover\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/02\/IMG_1291-min-scaled.jpg 2560w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/02\/IMG_1291-min-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/02\/IMG_1291-min-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/02\/IMG_1291-min-768x512.jpg 768w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/02\/IMG_1291-min-1536x1024.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/02\/IMG_1291-min-2048x1365.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/02\/IMG_1291-min-16x12.jpg 16w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 2560px) 100vw, 2560px\" \/><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\">\n<div class=\"is-layout-flex wp-container-10 wp-block-columns\">\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column\">\n<h2 class=\"has-text-align-center\">Download Brochure<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-horizontal is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-6 wp-block-buttons\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\">Download<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-layout-flow wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\">\n<h2 class=\"has-text-align-center\">Download Fact Sheet<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"is-horizontal is-content-justification-center is-layout-flex wp-container-8 wp-block-buttons\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2021\/04\/FACTsheets.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Download<\/a><\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<style class=\"advgb-styles-renderer\">#advgb-cols-ade49356-e8a5-41df-9fe6-4df6b8cb2765{}@media screen and (max-width: 1023px) {#advgb-cols-ade49356-e8a5-41df-9fe6-4df6b8cb2765{}}@media screen and (max-width: 767px) {#advgb-cols-ade49356-e8a5-41df-9fe6-4df6b8cb2765{}}#advgb-col-882756fe-de92-451e-95a2-ba727facbda2>.advgb-column-inner{}#advgb-col-882756fe-de92-451e-95a2-ba727facbda2{width: 40%;}@media screen and (max-width: 1023px) {#advgb-col-882756fe-de92-451e-95a2-ba727facbda2>.advgb-column-inner{}}@media screen and (max-width: 767px) {#advgb-col-882756fe-de92-451e-95a2-ba727facbda2>.advgb-column-inner{}}#advgb-col-1d678a07-4a88-470b-8169-2ba798fc5ee1>.advgb-column-inner{padding-top:40px;padding-right:25px;padding-bottom:40px;padding-left:25px;}@media screen and (max-width: 1023px) {#advgb-col-1d678a07-4a88-470b-8169-2ba798fc5ee1>.advgb-column-inner{}}@media screen and (max-width: 767px) {#advgb-col-1d678a07-4a88-470b-8169-2ba798fc5ee1>.advgb-column-inner{}}#advgb-cols-3b896de5-89ca-4c95-8d8a-763f1f2522c1{}@media screen and (max-width: 1023px) {#advgb-cols-3b896de5-89ca-4c95-8d8a-763f1f2522c1{}}@media screen and (max-width: 767px) {#advgb-cols-3b896de5-89ca-4c95-8d8a-763f1f2522c1{}}#advgb-col-c71df459-9949-4912-bca3-08b96905a149>.advgb-column-inner{}@media screen and (max-width: 1023px) {#advgb-col-c71df459-9949-4912